WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.066
One heritage site. Three ways to learn.

00:00:02.066 --> 00:00:02.980
Thang Long Imperial Citadel,

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.407
through the eyes of students at three levels.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:07.958
Primary students learn step by step:

00:00:07.958 --> 00:00:09.108
hear a story, look at pictures,

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:10.267
play, then earn stars.

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:15.356
Big cards with pictures,

00:00:15.356 --> 00:00:16.586
questions read aloud,

00:00:16.586 --> 00:00:18.083
and no timer. When they finish,

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:19.447
they earn stars and badges.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.505
Lower secondary tests mix question types:

00:00:23.505 --> 00:00:24.486
single choice,

00:00:24.486 --> 00:00:25.777
true or false, ordering,

00:00:25.777 --> 00:00:28.023
fill in the blank. If teachers set a time limit, a countdown

00:00:28.023 --> 00:00:28.287
runs.

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:32.141
Submit, and the score appears, with an explanation for each

00:00:32.141 --> 00:00:32.457
question.

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.594
Upper secondary lessons are documents to read on your own.

00:00:38.594 --> 00:00:40.487
Tests include reading a source and answering,

00:00:40.487 --> 00:00:41.722
judging each statement true or false,

00:00:41.722 --> 00:00:42.717
and there's always a timer.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.499
Results show a score and analysis by topic,

00:00:47.499 --> 00:00:48.677
so you know which parts you've mastered.

00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:54.157
And teachers see results for the whole class,

00:00:54.157 --> 00:00:55.312
at their class's own level.

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:01.927
DiViet. Discover Vietnam's heritage.
